## Model Setup (Not Stored in Repository)

Due to size constraints, model files are not included in this repository.

### Models Used
- TinyLLaMA-1.1B (Q4_K_M, GGUF)
- LLaMA 3.1-8B (quantized)

### Download Instructions
1. Create a `models/` directory
2. Download the required model manually or using a script
3. Place the model files inside `models/`
